---
---
<section id="opinia" class="tm">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Rekomendacja z LinkedIn</p>
    <figure class="tm-card">
      <blockquote class="tm-quote">
        „Kamil and his team at Profil Software played a pivotal role in the
        creation of our complex SaaS solution. He is a top-level software
        engineering leader with vast, hands-on technical knowledge and great
        management skills. I have observed Kamil navigate through various
        technical challenges while mentoring his team to deliver exceptional
        results. It's been a great pleasure working with him, and highly
        recommend Kamil for leadership roles in software engineering.”
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption class="tm-by">
        <img
          class="tm-avatar"
          src="/oleg.jpg"
          alt="Oleg Sinitsin"
          width="56"
          height="56"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <span class="tm-meta">
          <span class="tm-name">Oleg Sinitsin</span>
          <span class="tm-role">VP, RevOps &amp; Strategic Accounts</span>
          <span class="tm-ctx">kwiecień 2024 · był klientem Kamila</span>
        </span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tm { background: var(--paper-pure); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .tm .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .tm-card {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
  }
  .tm-quote {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .tm-by {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .tm-avatar {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .tm-meta { display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.35; }
  .tm-name { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .tm-role { font-size: var(--step--1); color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .tm-ctx {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }
</style>
